  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.UI_Panels.BasisUIInput
    MemberName: moveRepeatRate
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: Delay in seconds between repeated move actions while move is actuated.
    Remarks: "While move is being held down, the input module will first wait for
      moveRepeatDelay seconds\n after the first actuation of move and then trigger
      a move event every moveRepeatRate seconds.\n\n Note that a maximum of one AxisEventData
      will be sent per frame. This means that even if multiple time\n increments
      of the repeat delay have passed since the last update, only one move repeat
      event will be generated."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs:
