    Summary: "A Transform representing the real world origin for tracking devices.\n
      This is used to convert real world positions and rotations for UIPointerType.Tracked
      pointers into Unity's global space.\n When using the XR Interaction Toolkit,
      this should be pointing to the XR Rig's Transform."
    Remarks: This will transform all tracked pointers. If unset, or set to null,
      the Unity world origin will be used as the basis for all tracked positions
