  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.BasisAudioAndVisemeDriver
    MemberName: BasisAudioAndVisemeDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Connects a `uLipSync` pipeline to an avatar's facial rig by mapping
      phonemes to\n blendshapes and forwarding audio samples to the lip-sync engine."
    Remarks: "Initialization validates avatar resources, builds a phoneme\u2192blendshape
      table from the avatar's\n `FaceVisemeMovement`, configures uLipSyncBlendShape
      with those mappings,\n and wires visibility callbacks so processing pauses
      when the face is hidden.\n \n\n\n\n\n Call ProcessAudioSamples(float[], int,
      int) each audio frame to drive lip sync.\n Call TryInitialize(BasisPlayer)
      when the player/avatar becomes available and\n TryShutdown on teardown."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
