  - TypeFullName: BasisHeightDriver
    MemberName: ChangeEyeHeightMode
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 2
    ParamNames:
    - localPlayer
    - selectedHeightMode
    ParamDocs:
    - The target BasisLocalPlayer whose height/ratios will be updated.
    - The height computation mode that determines which ratios to apply.
    Summary: Adjusts the player's eye height after allowing devices and systems to
      reset to native size, then notifies listeners next frame.
    Remarks: "Establishes authoritative avatar metrics (eye height, arm span) first,
      then captures live player metrics.\n Ensures nonzero defaults, computes scale
      ratios safely, picks the active ratio set for `selectedHeightMode`,\n and invokes
      BasisLocalPlayer.OnPlayersHeightChangedNextFrame via BasisLocalPlayer.ExecuteNextFrame(System.Action)."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
