  - TypeFullName: BasisHeightDriver
    MemberName: CapturePlayerHeight
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - localPlayer
    ParamDocs:
    - The BasisLocalPlayer whose measurements will be populated.
    Summary: Captures live player eye height and arm span from connected input devices,
      using avatar/default fallbacks when necessary.
    Remarks: "Eye height is read from BasisLocalCameraDriver.Instance lock-to-input
      if available, otherwise falls back to avatar eye height or default.\n Arm span
      uses left/right hand devices; if either hand is missing, the default arm span
      is used."
