  - TypeFullName: BasisHeightDriver
    MemberName: SetCustomPlayerHeight
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - customHeight
    ParamDocs:
    - Desired eye height in meters. Must be greater than zero.
    Summary: "Applies a custom player eye height, persists it, recomputes ratios
      in ChangeEyeHeightMode,\n updates avatar scale, rescales TPose bone data, and
      notifies listeners next frame."
    Remarks: "Uses the recomputed unscaled avatar eye height as the baseline to compute
      the avatar height scale factor.\n Updates BasisLocalAvatarDriver.ScaleAvatarModification
      and adjusts TPose-scaled transforms on each bone control."
