  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Animator_Driver.BasisLocalAnimatorDriver
    MemberName: BasisLocalAnimatorDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: Drives a local player's Animator parameters from character and tracker
      data.
    Remarks: "This driver samples positional and angular motion from the character
      and hips control, applies smoothing,\n and writes results into a cached set
      of animator variables via BasisAnimatorVariableApply.\n It also reacts to character
      events (jump/land) and (re)binds a hips tracker when device lists change."
    Returns: 
