  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Animator_Driver.BasisLocalAnimatorDriver
    MemberName: SimulateAnimator
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - DeltaTime
    ParamDocs:
    - Delta time in seconds since the previous simulation step.
    Summary: Samples motion and state, applies smoothing, updates animator variables,
      and pushes values into the animator.
    Remarks: "This method returns early and halts variable application when T-posing
      or when full-body IK trackers are present.\n Velocity is computed in hips-local
      space, sanitized for NaN/Inf, and smoothed using an exponential spring-like
      filter.\n Angular velocity is derived from hips delta rotation and interpolated
      to reduce jitter."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
