  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Eye_Follow.BasisLocalEyeDriver
    MemberName: BasisLocalEyeDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Drives local eye \u201Clook around\u201D behavior for the local avatar
      by periodically\n picking randomized gaze offsets relative to the head and
      smoothly rotating\n eye bones toward those targets. Integrates with gizmos
      and face visibility."
    Remarks: "This component:\n \n- Subscribes to local player spawn and renderer
      visibility to enable/disable updates.\n- Randomizes gaze offsets and speeds
      within configured ranges.\n- Optionally visualizes per\u2013eye targets via
      BasisGizmoManager.\n\n Updates are skipped when Override is `true` or when
      no head is present."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
