  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkHandleVoice
    MemberName: HandleAudioUpdate
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - Reader
    ParamDocs:
    - Network packet reader positioned at a voice segment.
    Summary: "Reads one audio packet from `Reader`, routes it to the target player,\n
      and recycles the message object back into the queue."
    Remarks: "- Cancels any in-progress processing to prefer the most recent packet.\n
      - Serializes access via semaphore; if not obtained within\n   TimeoutMilliseconds,
      processing is effectively skipped.\n - Uses a bounded queue as a lightweight
      object pool to reduce GC pressure."
